title: Conductor 0.3.0 — Workspace Manager + Eyebrow Voice Control + Custom Bindings (S8–S13)
summary: Implemented six sprints (S8–S13) transforming Conductor from a passive 320px floating overlay into a full workspace manager and extensible multimodal input system. 29 new source files, 6 new test files, 26 modifications — wiring together eyebrow detection, voice pipeline, gaze-to-grid targeting, custom gesture recording (DTW), and voice command binding into a unified InputOrchestrator. All 102 tests pass, clean release build.
